# One node per line — full SSH hostname as given by CloudLab.
# First line is treated as the LB node when --separate-lb is set (default).
# When --no-separate-lb, node0 runs both LB and one backend.
#
# Example (11 nodes: 1 LB + 10 backends, Utah xl170 cluster):
node0.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node1.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node2.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node3.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node4.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node5.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node6.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node7.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node8.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node9.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
node10.myexperiment.myproject.utah.cloudlab.us
